WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.360
Backhand slice for complete beginners.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.500 line:10%
Ball machine market

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.500 line:10%
Market leader

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.500
Straight through, push it out.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:42.300
From start to finish, don't open up your body early; stay side-on the whole time.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.045
At contact the racket face stays upright and drives through the back of the ball,

00:00:47.045 --> 00:00:49.460
rather than lying flat and slicing under it.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:54.640
At the moment of contact the forearm is straight; don't hit with a bent arm.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.780
As the right hand hits, the left hand reaches back to help the diagonal stretch.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:05.410
Once you have the technique, we use the ball machine for fixed-point practice across the net.
